Third-party data
----------------

examples/data/walnut_cone.npz is a downsampled derivative of

    Meaney, Alexander (2022). "Cone-Beam Computed Tomography Dataset of a
    Walnut." Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6986012

licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The walnut images in
docs/assets/ (walnut_measured.png, walnut_helical.png, diffct_intro.gif,
diffct_intro.mp4) are reconstructions from these data. Credit the dataset as
above when you reuse them. examples/data/NOTICE describes the preprocessing.
